# ─── Marketing collateral & working drafts at the repo root ───
# These are local working files (campaign plans, ad copy, valuation drafts,
# parent letters, demo handouts, etc.) — kept locally, not tracked. Binary
# .docx / .xlsx files generate noisy diffs nobody can review and bloat the
# repo. Move to a docs/ folder or external drive when shared.
/Conference-*.docx
/Curriculate-*.docx
/Curriculate-*.xlsx
/Curriculate-*.html
/Curriculate-Report-*.pdf
/Curriculate-Valuation-*.docx
/Elementary-*.docx
/Parent-Letter-*.docx
/Student-Practice-*.docx
/email-preview.html
/x-banner.html
/report-preview.pdf

# ─── Source / reference logos at the repo root ───
